window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b398-7730dde47e5eaeaa.json"]={sha256:"7730dde47e5eaeaae92fe414e713ccdbb5442ac4945dc9c683abab1afa42bac3",value:{"id":"b398","title":"懸掛式單軌轉轍系統","titleEn":"Suspended-monorail switch systems","category":"rail","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課聚焦懸掛轉轍的承載路徑機構定位與鎖定證據。從可動構件力行程帳建立物理或資訊邊界，接著把致動推力與獨立保持與動作回授的事件次序連成可驗證的介面，最後以維修恢復與服務條件整理證據。學徒逐一完成機制推導、數值算例、失效辨識及參數實驗，所有練習限定在離線模型或隔離教具，保留假設與量測的不確定度。","summaryEn":"This course studies load paths, positioning and locking evidence in suspended-monorail switches. Start with force-travel work of moving members to define physical or information boundaries, connect actuation thrust and independent holding with event ordering in actuator feedback as verifiable interfaces, and organize evidence through maintenance recovery and service conditions. Each unit develops a mechanism, numerical example, failure diagnosis and parameter experiment in an offline model or isolated teaching rig, retaining assumptions and measurement uncertainty.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、軌道進入、牽引供電隔離或列車營運許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, track-access, traction-power isolation or train-operation permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"rail-integration","subcategoryTitle":"車站機廠與系統整合","subcategoryTitleEn":"Stations depots and integration","learningTrack":"rail","learningSubdiscipline":"rail-integration","learningTags":["rail","rail-integration","track"],"architectureFamily":"rail-integration","architectureNodes":[["懸掛載重","Suspended load"],["轉轍梁位","Switch beam position"],["連桿驅動","Linkage drive"],["位置確認","Position confirmation"],["隔離試驗","Isolated testing"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"rail-integration","labels":["懸掛載重","轉轍梁位","連桿驅動","位置確認","隔離試驗"],"labelsEn":["Suspended load","Switch beam position","Linkage drive","Position confirmation","Isolated testing"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"原創整合工作單，所有輸入均為教學假設而非代表工程實測：先研究可動構件力行程帳。原創假想教學輸入：作用力 F=4500 N；作用行程 s=0.12 m；機械效率 eta=0.65 1。公式 y=F*s/eta，代入得 y=830.769 J。邊界：定力準靜態構件行程與定效率，不含動態衝擊或懸掛式轉轍的實際保持要求。敏感度只改 F=4500 至 4950 N，輸出變為 913.846 J；離散計數採整數變化。再獨立研究轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩：原創假想教學輸入：切向作用力 F=1800 N；力臂 r=0.08 m。公式 y=F*r，代入得 y=144 N*m。邊界：準靜態剛性連桿力矩，不包含實際懸掛式轉轍構造、動態衝擊或額定設計。兩個結果不能因同一課程就任意相加，必須先確認單位、因果順序及共同邊界。用假想轉轍構件的力與位移建立準靜態作功，不假定其機構等同一般尖軌。比較往返曲線的差異，找出摩擦或對位偏差可能出現的行程位置。最後提出一項量測能區分模型假設失效與儀器偏差，將輸入表、重算結果和適用限制一併交付。","textEn":"Original integrated worksheet; every input is a teaching assumption rather than a measurement from a reference project. First investigate force-travel work of moving members. Original hypothetical teaching inputs: applied force F=4500 N; travel s=0.12 m; mechanical efficiency eta=0.65 1. Formula y=F*s/eta gives y=830.769 J. Boundary: Constant-force quasistatic member travel and fixed efficiency, excluding dynamic impact and actual suspended-switch retention requirements. For sensitivity, change only F=4500 to 4950 N; the output becomes 913.846 J. Discrete counts use whole-number steps. Independently investigate switch-linkage lever arm and torque: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: tangential force F=1800 N; lever arm r=0.08 m. Formula y=F*r gives y=144 N*m. Boundary: Quasistatic rigid-link torque, excluding actual suspended-switch construction, impact dynamics and rated design. Results cannot be added merely because they belong to the same course: check units, causal sequence and shared boundaries first. Build quasistatic work from a hypothetical moving member without equating it to a conventional switch blade. Compare forward and reverse curves to locate possible friction or alignment effects. Propose one measurement distinguishing a failed model assumption from instrument bias, and deliver the input table, recomputed results and applicability limits together.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":16,"enrichmentVersion":16,"stages":[{"id":"b398-v16-s1","title":"可動構件力行程帳與轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩","titleEn":"Force-travel work of moving members & Switch-linkage lever arm and torque","description":"本階段聚焦「可動構件力行程帳」與「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Force-travel work of moving members\" and \"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b398-v16-01","title":"可動構件力行程帳：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Force-travel work of moving members: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「可動構件力行程帳」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Force-travel work of moving members” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"用假想轉轍構件的力與位移建立準靜態作功，不假定其機構等同一般尖軌。比較往返曲線的差異，找出摩擦或對位偏差可能出現的行程位置。致動器輸入能量必須支應負載作功與摩擦損失。相同行程不代表相同負載，潤滑、對位與溫度會改變力的分布；只看總電流峰值可能忽略行程中某一位置的卡滯，需把力與位移配對。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：定力準靜態構件行程與定效率，不含動態衝擊或懸掛式轉轍的實際保持要求。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「可動構件力行程帳」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Build quasistatic work from a hypothetical moving member without equating it to a conventional switch blade. Compare forward and reverse curves to locate possible friction or alignment effects. Actuator input energy must cover load work and frictional loss. Equal travel does not imply equal loading because lubrication, alignment and temperature change force distribution. A single current peak can miss binding at a particular position, so force should be paired with displacement. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Constant-force quasistatic member travel and fixed efficiency, excluding dynamic impact and actual suspended-switch retention requirements. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Force-travel work of moving members” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：作用力 F=4500 N；作用行程 s=0.12 m；機械效率 eta=0.65 1。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: applied force F=4500 N; travel s=0.12 m; mechanical efficiency eta=0.65 1.","failure":"常見誤解：「致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「可動構件力行程帳」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Force-travel work of moving members”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-01-k1","title":"可動構件力行程帳","titleEn":"Force-travel work of moving members","text":"用假想轉轍構件的力與位移建立準靜態作功，不假定其機構等同一般尖軌。比較往返曲線的差異，找出摩擦或對位偏差可能出現的行程位置。","textEn":"Build quasistatic work from a hypothetical moving member without equating it to a conventional switch blade. Compare forward and reverse curves to locate possible friction or alignment effects.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「可動構件力行程帳」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Force-travel work of moving members\" is correct?","options":["致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉","用假想轉轍構件的力與位移建立準靜態作功，不假定其機構等同一般尖軌。","馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成"],"optionsEn":["Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking.","Build quasistatic work from a hypothetical moving member without equating it to a conventional switch blade.","The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用假想轉轍構件的力與位移建立準靜態作功，不假定其機構等同一般尖軌。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Build quasistatic work from a hypothetical moving member without equating it to a conventional switch blade. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b398-v16-02","title":"可動構件力行程帳：定量估算","titleEn":"Force-travel work of moving members: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「可動構件力行程帳」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Force-travel work of moving members” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：作用力 F=4500 N；作用行程 s=0.12 m；機械效率 eta=0.65 1。公式 y=F*s/eta，代入得 y=830.769 J。邊界：定力準靜態構件行程與定效率，不含動態衝擊或懸掛式轉轍的實際保持要求。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: applied force F=4500 N; travel s=0.12 m; mechanical efficiency eta=0.65 1. Formula y=F*s/eta gives y=830.769 J. Boundary: Constant-force quasistatic member travel and fixed efficiency, excluding dynamic impact and actual suspended-switch retention requirements. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在隔離試驗台同步記錄力、位移與電流，積分力位移曲線並比較往返差異。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: On an isolated bench, synchronize force, displacement and current, integrate the force-travel curve and compare both directions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：作用力 F=4500 N；作用行程 s=0.12 m；機械效率 eta=0.65 1。公式 y=F*s/eta，代入得 y=830.769 J。邊界：定力準靜態構件行程與定效率，不含動態衝擊或懸掛式轉轍的實際保持要求。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: applied force F=4500 N; travel s=0.12 m; mechanical efficiency eta=0.65 1. Formula y=F*s/eta gives y=830.769 J. Boundary: Constant-force quasistatic member travel and fixed efficiency, excluding dynamic impact and actual suspended-switch retention requirements.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「可動構件力行程帳」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Force-travel work of moving members\", which statement holds?","options":["油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","原創假想教學輸入：作用力 F=4500 N；作用行程 s=0.12 m；機械效率 eta=0.65 1。"],"optionsEn":["A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: applied force F=4500 N; travel s=0.12 m; mechanical efficiency eta=0.65 1."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：作用力 F=4500 N；作用行程 s=0.12 m；機械效率 eta=0.65 1。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: applied force F=4500 N; travel s=0.12 m; mechanical efficiency eta=0.65 1. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b398-v16-03","title":"可動構件力行程帳：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Force-travel work of moving members: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「可動構件力行程帳」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Force-travel work of moving members” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在隔離試驗台同步記錄力、位移與電流，積分力位移曲線並比較往返差異。以「可動構件力行程帳」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"On an isolated bench, synchronize force, displacement and current, integrate the force-travel curve and compare both directions. For force-travel work of moving members, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把作用力 F 從 4500 改成 4950 N（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 830.769 變為 913.846 J。先說明「可動構件力行程帳」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only applied force F from 4500 to 4950 N (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 830.769 to 913.846 J. Explain the causal direction for force-travel work of moving members, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：摩擦增加與機構偏心都能提高能耗，但其位置依賴不同；行程結束也不等於鎖閉已被證明。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Friction and misalignment both increase energy but differ with position; reaching the end of travel does not prove locking. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在隔離試驗台同步記錄力、位移與電流，積分力位移曲線並比較往返差異。以「可動構件力行程帳」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"On an isolated bench, synchronize force, displacement and current, integrate the force-travel curve and compare both directions. For force-travel work of moving members, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把作用力 F 從 4500 改成 4950 N（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 830.769 變為 913.846 J。先說明「可動構件力行程帳」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only applied force F from 4500 to 4950 N (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 830.769 to 913.846 J. Explain the causal direction for force-travel work of moving members, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「可動構件力行程帳」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Force-travel work of moving members\"?","options":["在隔離試驗台同步記錄力、位移與電流，積分力位移曲線並比較往返差異。","量測時不必記錄溫度、速度、運行歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障"],"optionsEn":["On an isolated bench, synchronize force, displacement and current, integrate the force-travel curve and compare both directions.","Temperature, speed, operating history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在隔離試驗台同步記錄力、位移與電流，積分力位移曲線並比較往返差異。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"On an isolated bench, synchronize force, displacement and current, integrate the force-travel curve and compare both directions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b398-v16-04","title":"可動構件力行程帳：失效診斷","titleEn":"Force-travel work of moving members: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「可動構件力行程帳」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Force-travel work of moving members” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"摩擦增加與機構偏心都能提高能耗，但其位置依賴不同；行程結束也不等於鎖閉已被證明。回到「可動構件力行程帳」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Friction and misalignment both increase energy but differ with position; reaching the end of travel does not prove locking. Trace the input chain for force-travel work of moving members. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：定力準靜態構件行程與定效率，不含動態衝擊或懸掛式轉轍的實際保持要求。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Constant-force quasistatic member travel and fixed efficiency, excluding dynamic impact and actual suspended-switch retention requirements.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"摩擦增加與機構偏心都能提高能耗，但其位置依賴不同；行程結束也不等於鎖閉已被證明。回到「可動構件力行程帳」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Friction and misalignment both increase energy but differ with position; reaching the end of travel does not prove locking. Trace the input chain for force-travel work of moving members. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「可動構件力行程帳」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Force-travel work of moving members\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","摩擦增加與機構偏心都能提高能耗，但其位置依賴不同；行程結束也不等於鎖閉已被證明。","馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Friction and misalignment both increase energy but differ with position; reaching the end of travel does not prove locking.","The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam."],"answer":1,"explanation":"摩擦增加與機構偏心都能提高能耗，但其位置依賴不同；行程結束也不等於鎖閉已被證明。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Friction and misalignment both increase energy but differ with position; reaching the end of travel does not prove locking. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b398-v16-05","title":"轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-04"],"objective":"說明「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Switch-linkage lever arm and torque” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"轉轍構件的力臂必須垂直於作用力，不能把連桿全長直接代入。比較不同幾何位置的機械利益，明確保留簡化定力臂未描述的死點行為。懸掛式轉轍梁的驅動力矩由致動力與垂直有效力臂相乘，連桿角度會讓有效力臂隨行程改變。馬達輸出足夠不代表遠端梁位已到達，彈性變形、齒隙與摩擦均會改變傳力；機械保持及位置確認必須有獨立證據，不能由一次成功轉動推論。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：準靜態剛性連桿力矩，不包含實際懸掛式轉轍構造、動態衝擊或額定設計。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Use the perpendicular lever arm rather than the entire linkage length. Compare mechanical advantage across positions and retain dead-centre behaviour omitted by a constant-arm approximation. Drive torque for a suspended switch beam is actuator force times perpendicular effective lever arm, which changes with linkage angle. Adequate motor output does not establish that the remote beam has arrived. Compliance, backlash and friction affect force transfer; mechanical retention and position confirmation need independent evidence rather than inference from one successful movement. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Quasistatic rigid-link torque, excluding actual suspended-switch construction, impact dynamics and rated design. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Switch-linkage lever arm and torque” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：切向作用力 F=1800 N；力臂 r=0.08 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: tangential force F=1800 N; lever arm r=0.08 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Switch-linkage lever arm and torque”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-05-k1","title":"轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩","titleEn":"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque","text":"轉轍構件的力臂必須垂直於作用力，不能把連桿全長直接代入。比較不同幾何位置的機械利益，明確保留簡化定力臂未描述的死點行為。","textEn":"Use the perpendicular lever arm rather than the entire linkage length. Compare mechanical advantage across positions and retain dead-centre behaviour omitted by a constant-arm approximation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque\" is correct?","options":["馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成","兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零","轉轍構件的力臂必須垂直於作用力，不能把連桿全長直接代入。"],"optionsEn":["The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam.","Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.","Use the perpendicular lever arm rather than the entire linkage length."],"answer":2,"explanation":"轉轍構件的力臂必須垂直於作用力，不能把連桿全長直接代入。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Use the perpendicular lever arm rather than the entire linkage length. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b398-v16-06","title":"轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩：定量估算","titleEn":"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Switch-linkage lever arm and torque” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：切向作用力 F=1800 N；力臂 r=0.08 m。公式 y=F*r，代入得 y=144 N*m。邊界：準靜態剛性連桿力矩，不包含實際懸掛式轉轍構造、動態衝擊或額定設計。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: tangential force F=1800 N; lever arm r=0.08 m. Formula y=F*r gives y=144 N*m. Boundary: Quasistatic rigid-link torque, excluding actual suspended-switch construction, impact dynamics and rated design. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用縮尺連桿同時量測力與垂直力臂，在不同角度比較力矩，再以獨立位移計核對遠端梁的位置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure force and perpendicular lever arm on a scale linkage at several angles, then independently check remote beam position with a displacement sensor.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：切向作用力 F=1800 N；力臂 r=0.08 m。公式 y=F*r，代入得 y=144 N*m。邊界：準靜態剛性連桿力矩，不包含實際懸掛式轉轍構造、動態衝擊或額定設計。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: tangential force F=1800 N; lever arm r=0.08 m. Formula y=F*r gives y=144 N*m. Boundary: Quasistatic rigid-link torque, excluding actual suspended-switch construction, impact dynamics and rated design.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque\", which statement holds?","options":["原創假想教學輸入：切向作用力 F=1800 N；力臂 r=0.08 m。","總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Original hypothetical teaching inputs: tangential force F=1800 N; lever arm r=0.08 m.","Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：切向作用力 F=1800 N；力臂 r=0.08 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: tangential force F=1800 N; lever arm r=0.08 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b398-v16-07","title":"轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Switch-linkage lever arm and torque” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用縮尺連桿同時量測力與垂直力臂，在不同角度比較力矩，再以獨立位移計核對遠端梁的位置。以「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure force and perpendicular lever arm on a scale linkage at several angles, then independently check remote beam position with a displacement sensor. For switch-linkage lever arm and torque, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把力臂 r 從 0.08 改成 0.088 m（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 144 變為 158.4 N*m。先說明「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only lever arm r from 0.08 to 0.088 m (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 144 to 158.4 N*m. Explain the causal direction for switch-linkage lever arm and torque, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：連桿接近不利幾何時所需力會提高，齒隙又可能使馬達角度改變卻沒有相應梁位移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Unfavourable linkage geometry raises required force, while backlash can allow motor-angle change without corresponding beam displacement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用縮尺連桿同時量測力與垂直力臂，在不同角度比較力矩，再以獨立位移計核對遠端梁的位置。以「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Measure force and perpendicular lever arm on a scale linkage at several angles, then independently check remote beam position with a displacement sensor. For switch-linkage lever arm and torque, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把力臂 r 從 0.08 改成 0.088 m（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 144 變為 158.4 N*m。先說明「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only lever arm r from 0.08 to 0.088 m (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 144 to 158.4 N*m. Explain the causal direction for switch-linkage lever arm and torque, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque\"?","options":["沿用另一處鐵路設施或路線的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","用縮尺連桿同時量測力與垂直力臂，在不同角度比較力矩，再以獨立位移計核對遠端梁的位置。","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another railway facility or route counts as verifying this structure.","Measure force and perpendicular lever arm on a scale linkage at several angles, then independently check remote beam position with a displacement sensor.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用縮尺連桿同時量測力與垂直力臂，在不同角度比較力矩，再以獨立位移計核對遠端梁的位置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure force and perpendicular lever arm on a scale linkage at several angles, then independently check remote beam position with a displacement sensor. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b398-v16-08","title":"轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩：失效診斷","titleEn":"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Switch-linkage lever arm and torque” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"連桿接近不利幾何時所需力會提高，齒隙又可能使馬達角度改變卻沒有相應梁位移。回到「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Unfavourable linkage geometry raises required force, while backlash can allow motor-angle change without corresponding beam displacement. Trace the input chain for switch-linkage lever arm and torque. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：準靜態剛性連桿力矩，不包含實際懸掛式轉轍構造、動態衝擊或額定設計。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Quasistatic rigid-link torque, excluding actual suspended-switch construction, impact dynamics and rated design.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"連桿接近不利幾何時所需力會提高，齒隙又可能使馬達角度改變卻沒有相應梁位移。回到「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Unfavourable linkage geometry raises required force, while backlash can allow motor-angle change without corresponding beam displacement. Trace the input chain for switch-linkage lever arm and torque. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Switch-linkage lever arm and torque\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零","連桿接近不利幾何時所需力會提高，齒隙又可能使馬達角度改變卻沒有相應梁位移。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.","Unfavourable linkage geometry raises required force, while backlash can allow motor-angle change without corresponding beam displacement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"連桿接近不利幾何時所需力會提高，齒隙又可能使馬達角度改變卻沒有相應梁位移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Unfavourable linkage geometry raises required force, while backlash can allow motor-angle change without corresponding beam displacement. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b398-v16-s2","title":"多致動點位置差與致動推力與獨立保持","titleEn":"Position mismatch across actuators & Actuation thrust and independent holding","description":"本階段聚焦「多致動點位置差」與「致動推力與獨立保持」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Position mismatch across actuators\" and \"Actuation thrust and independent holding\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b398-v16-09","title":"多致動點位置差：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Position mismatch across actuators: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-08"],"objective":"說明「多致動點位置差」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Position mismatch across actuators” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"同一可動梁的多個致動點若不同步，微小速度差可能累積成扭斜。以共同時基追蹤位置差和負載轉移，不把平均行程完成當成各點同時到位。耦合致動器的小速度差會隨動作時間累積成行程差，使連桿扭轉或局部阻力增加。位置回授能限制累積，卻仍需共同座標和獨立零點檢查；兩個馬達瞬間轉速相同只代表該時刻差值不再增加，並不能消除先前留下的位置偏移。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：定速度差的運動學模型，未含閉迴路補償與結構柔度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「多致動點位置差」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Small speed differences among actuators on one moving beam can accumulate into skew. Track position differences and load transfer on a common clock rather than treating mean completed travel as simultaneous arrival. A small speed difference between coupled actuators accumulates into travel mismatch, twisting linkages or increasing local resistance. Position feedback can limit accumulation but requires a common coordinate and independent zero checks. Equal instantaneous motor speeds only stop further growth at that instant; they do not remove the position offset already accumulated. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Kinematic model with constant speed difference; feedback correction and structural compliance are excluded. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Position mismatch across actuators” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：致動端一速度 v1=0.012 m/s；致動端二速度 v2=0.0115 m/s；動作時間 t=20 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first actuator speed v1=0.012 m/s; second actuator speed v2=0.0115 m/s; motion time t=20 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「多致動點位置差」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Position mismatch across actuators”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-09-k1","title":"多致動點位置差","titleEn":"Position mismatch across actuators","text":"同一可動梁的多個致動點若不同步，微小速度差可能累積成扭斜。以共同時基追蹤位置差和負載轉移，不把平均行程完成當成各點同時到位。","textEn":"Small speed differences among actuators on one moving beam can accumulate into skew. Track position differences and load transfer on a common clock rather than treating mean completed travel as simultaneous arrival.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「多致動點位置差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Position mismatch across actuators\" is correct?","options":["同一可動梁的多個致動點若不同步，微小速度差可能累積成扭斜。","兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零","油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位"],"optionsEn":["Small speed differences among actuators on one moving beam can accumulate into skew.","Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.","A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同一可動梁的多個致動點若不同步，微小速度差可能累積成扭斜。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Small speed differences among actuators on one moving beam can accumulate into skew. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b398-v16-10","title":"多致動點位置差：定量估算","titleEn":"Position mismatch across actuators: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「多致動點位置差」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Position mismatch across actuators” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：致動端一速度 v1=0.012 m/s；致動端二速度 v2=0.0115 m/s；動作時間 t=20 s。公式 y=(v1-v2)*t*1000，代入得 y=10 mm。邊界：定速度差的運動學模型，未含閉迴路補償與結構柔度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first actuator speed v1=0.012 m/s; second actuator speed v2=0.0115 m/s; motion time t=20 s. Formula y=(v1-v2)*t*1000 gives y=10 mm. Boundary: Kinematic model with constant speed difference; feedback correction and structural compliance are excluded. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以獨立位移計同時量測兩個連接點，對照編碼器零點與連桿幾何，再比較低負載及偏載時的誤差斜率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure both connection points simultaneously with independent displacement sensors, compare encoder zeros and linkage geometry, then compare drift slopes at low and uneven load.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：致動端一速度 v1=0.012 m/s；致動端二速度 v2=0.0115 m/s；動作時間 t=20 s。公式 y=(v1-v2)*t*1000，代入得 y=10 mm。邊界：定速度差的運動學模型，未含閉迴路補償與結構柔度。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first actuator speed v1=0.012 m/s; second actuator speed v2=0.0115 m/s; motion time t=20 s. Formula y=(v1-v2)*t*1000 gives y=10 mm. Boundary: Kinematic model with constant speed difference; feedback correction and structural compliance are excluded.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「多致動點位置差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Position mismatch across actuators\", which statement holds?","options":["狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","原創假想教學輸入：致動端一速度 v1=0.012 m/s；致動端二速度 v2=0.0115 m/s；動作時間 t=20 s。","裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障"],"optionsEn":["Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first actuator speed v1=0.012 m/s; second actuator speed v2=0.0115 m/s; motion time t=20 s.","Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：致動端一速度 v1=0.012 m/s；致動端二速度 v2=0.0115 m/s；動作時間 t=20 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first actuator speed v1=0.012 m/s; second actuator speed v2=0.0115 m/s; motion time t=20 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b398-v16-11","title":"多致動點位置差：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Position mismatch across actuators: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「多致動點位置差」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Position mismatch across actuators” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以獨立位移計同時量測兩個連接點，對照編碼器零點與連桿幾何，再比較低負載及偏載時的誤差斜率。以「多致動點位置差」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure both connection points simultaneously with independent displacement sensors, compare encoder zeros and linkage geometry, then compare drift slopes at low and uneven load. For position mismatch across actuators, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把動作時間 t 從 20 改成 22 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 10 變為 11 mm。先說明「多致動點位置差」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only motion time t from 20 to 22 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 10 to 11 mm. Explain the causal direction for position mismatch across actuators, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：某端摩擦增加會造成位移差斜率改變，共同零點錯誤則可能讓兩端回授一致卻偏離機構中線。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Extra friction at one end changes the mismatch slope, whereas a shared zero error can make feedback agree while the linkage is displaced from its reference. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以獨立位移計同時量測兩個連接點，對照編碼器零點與連桿幾何，再比較低負載及偏載時的誤差斜率。以「多致動點位置差」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Measure both connection points simultaneously with independent displacement sensors, compare encoder zeros and linkage geometry, then compare drift slopes at low and uneven load. For position mismatch across actuators, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把動作時間 t 從 20 改成 22 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 10 變為 11 mm。先說明「多致動點位置差」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only motion time t from 20 to 22 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 10 to 11 mm. Explain the causal direction for position mismatch across actuators, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「多致動點位置差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Position mismatch across actuators\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的","以獨立位移計同時量測兩個連接點，對照編碼器零點與連桿幾何，再比較低負載及偏載時的誤差斜率。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe.","Measure both connection points simultaneously with independent displacement sensors, compare encoder zeros and linkage geometry, then compare drift slopes at low and uneven load."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以獨立位移計同時量測兩個連接點，對照編碼器零點與連桿幾何，再比較低負載及偏載時的誤差斜率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure both connection points simultaneously with independent displacement sensors, compare encoder zeros and linkage geometry, then compare drift slopes at low and uneven load. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b398-v16-12","title":"多致動點位置差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Position mismatch across actuators: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「多致動點位置差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Position mismatch across actuators” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"某端摩擦增加會造成位移差斜率改變，共同零點錯誤則可能讓兩端回授一致卻偏離機構中線。回到「多致動點位置差」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Extra friction at one end changes the mismatch slope, whereas a shared zero error can make feedback agree while the linkage is displaced from its reference. Trace the input chain for position mismatch across actuators. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：定速度差的運動學模型，未含閉迴路補償與結構柔度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Kinematic model with constant speed difference; feedback correction and structural compliance are excluded.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"某端摩擦增加會造成位移差斜率改變，共同零點錯誤則可能讓兩端回授一致卻偏離機構中線。回到「多致動點位置差」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Extra friction at one end changes the mismatch slope, whereas a shared zero error can make feedback agree while the linkage is displaced from its reference. Trace the input chain for position mismatch across actuators. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「多致動點位置差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Position mismatch across actuators\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["某端摩擦增加會造成位移差斜率改變，共同零點錯誤則可能讓兩端回授一致卻偏離機構中線。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位"],"optionsEn":["Extra friction at one end changes the mismatch slope, whereas a shared zero error can make feedback agree while the linkage is displaced from its reference.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"某端摩擦增加會造成位移差斜率改變，共同零點錯誤則可能讓兩端回授一致卻偏離機構中線。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Extra friction at one end changes the mismatch slope, whereas a shared zero error can make feedback agree while the linkage is displaced from its reference. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b398-v16-13","title":"致動推力與獨立保持：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Actuation thrust and independent holding: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-12"],"objective":"說明「致動推力與獨立保持」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Actuation thrust and independent holding” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"液壓壓力乘有效面積只估算推力，不能單獨證明載車路徑已能承載。將定位、保持和位置確認分開列成介面，使用隔離教具觀察摩擦與背壓。液壓推力由壓力乘有效活塞面積決定，回程側面積與背壓可能不同。壓力達標並不保證位移同步，漏油、氣泡和摩擦會改變動作；安全承載還需獨立機械保持機制與設備規定，不能只依賴壓力表。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：單一活塞準靜態推力，未含背壓、管路瞬變與額定安全係數。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「致動推力與獨立保持」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pressure times effective area estimates thrust but does not establish a load-bearing train path. Separate positioning, holding and confirmation interfaces and inspect friction and back pressure on an isolated rig. Hydraulic force follows pressure times effective piston area, with different return-side area and back pressure possible. Target pressure does not guarantee synchronized movement because leakage, air and friction affect motion. Safe support also requires specified holding mechanisms rather than dependence on a pressure gauge alone. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Quasistatic force of one piston; back pressure, line transients and rated safety factors are excluded. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Actuation thrust and independent holding” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：油壓 p=12 MPa；活塞面積 A=0.008 m2；力傳遞效率 eta=0.9 1。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: hydraulic pressure p=12 MPa; piston area A=0.008 m2; force-transfer efficiency eta=0.9 1.","failure":"常見誤解：「油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「致動推力與獨立保持」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Actuation thrust and independent holding”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-13-k1","title":"致動推力與獨立保持","titleEn":"Actuation thrust and independent holding","text":"液壓壓力乘有效面積只估算推力，不能單獨證明載車路徑已能承載。將定位、保持和位置確認分開列成介面，使用隔離教具觀察摩擦與背壓。","textEn":"Pressure times effective area estimates thrust but does not establish a load-bearing train path. Separate positioning, holding and confirmation interfaces and inspect friction and back pressure on an isolated rig.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「致動推力與獨立保持」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Actuation thrust and independent holding\" is correct?","options":["油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位","液壓壓力乘有效面積只估算推力，不能單獨證明載車路徑已能承載。","總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變"],"optionsEn":["A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely.","Pressure times effective area estimates thrust but does not establish a load-bearing train path.","Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support."],"answer":1,"explanation":"液壓壓力乘有效面積只估算推力，不能單獨證明載車路徑已能承載。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pressure times effective area estimates thrust but does not establish a load-bearing train path. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b398-v16-14","title":"致動推力與獨立保持：定量估算","titleEn":"Actuation thrust and independent holding: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「致動推力與獨立保持」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Actuation thrust and independent holding” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：油壓 p=12 MPa；活塞面積 A=0.008 m2；力傳遞效率 eta=0.9 1。公式 y=p*1e6*A*eta/1000，代入得 y=86.4 kN。邊界：單一活塞準靜態推力，未含背壓、管路瞬變與額定安全係數。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: hydraulic pressure p=12 MPa; piston area A=0.008 m2; force-transfer efficiency eta=0.9 1. Formula y=p*1e6*A*eta/1000 gives y=86.4 kN. Boundary: Quasistatic force of one piston; back pressure, line transients and rated safety factors are excluded. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以獨立力感測器核對壓力推算，並記錄停留時的位移漂移與油溫變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare pressure-derived force with an independent load cell and record displacement drift and oil temperature during holding.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：油壓 p=12 MPa；活塞面積 A=0.008 m2；力傳遞效率 eta=0.9 1。公式 y=p*1e6*A*eta/1000，代入得 y=86.4 kN。邊界：單一活塞準靜態推力，未含背壓、管路瞬變與額定安全係數。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: hydraulic pressure p=12 MPa; piston area A=0.008 m2; force-transfer efficiency eta=0.9 1. Formula y=p*1e6*A*eta/1000 gives y=86.4 kN. Boundary: Quasistatic force of one piston; back pressure, line transients and rated safety factors are excluded.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「致動推力與獨立保持」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Actuation thrust and independent holding\", which statement holds?","options":["每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","原創假想教學輸入：油壓 p=12 MPa；活塞面積 A=0.008 m2；力傳遞效率 eta=0.9 1。"],"optionsEn":["Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: hydraulic pressure p=12 MPa; piston area A=0.008 m2; force-transfer efficiency eta=0.9 1."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：油壓 p=12 MPa；活塞面積 A=0.008 m2；力傳遞效率 eta=0.9 1。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: hydraulic pressure p=12 MPa; piston area A=0.008 m2; force-transfer efficiency eta=0.9 1. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b398-v16-15","title":"致動推力與獨立保持：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Actuation thrust and independent holding: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「致動推力與獨立保持」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Actuation thrust and independent holding” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以獨立力感測器核對壓力推算，並記錄停留時的位移漂移與油溫變化。以「致動推力與獨立保持」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare pressure-derived force with an independent load cell and record displacement drift and oil temperature during holding. For actuation thrust and independent holding, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把油壓 p 從 12 改成 13.2 MPa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 86.4 變為 95.04 kN。先說明「致動推力與獨立保持」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only hydraulic pressure p from 12 to 13.2 MPa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 86.4 to 95.04 kN. Explain the causal direction for actuation thrust and independent holding, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：內洩漏可造成保持位置下降但壓力讀值短時正常，空氣混入則可能使動作變軟並延遲。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Internal leakage can cause sag despite temporarily normal pressure, while entrained air makes motion compliant and delayed. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以獨立力感測器核對壓力推算，並記錄停留時的位移漂移與油溫變化。以「致動推力與獨立保持」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Compare pressure-derived force with an independent load cell and record displacement drift and oil temperature during holding. For actuation thrust and independent holding, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把油壓 p 從 12 改成 13.2 MPa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 86.4 變為 95.04 kN。先說明「致動推力與獨立保持」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only hydraulic pressure p from 12 to 13.2 MPa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 86.4 to 95.04 kN. Explain the causal direction for actuation thrust and independent holding, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「致動推力與獨立保持」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Actuation thrust and independent holding\"?","options":["以獨立力感測器核對壓力推算，並記錄停留時的位移漂移與油溫變化。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉"],"optionsEn":["Compare pressure-derived force with an independent load cell and record displacement drift and oil temperature during holding.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以獨立力感測器核對壓力推算，並記錄停留時的位移漂移與油溫變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare pressure-derived force with an independent load cell and record displacement drift and oil temperature during holding. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b398-v16-16","title":"致動推力與獨立保持：失效診斷","titleEn":"Actuation thrust and independent holding: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「致動推力與獨立保持」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Actuation thrust and independent holding” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"內洩漏可造成保持位置下降但壓力讀值短時正常，空氣混入則可能使動作變軟並延遲。回到「致動推力與獨立保持」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Internal leakage can cause sag despite temporarily normal pressure, while entrained air makes motion compliant and delayed. Trace the input chain for actuation thrust and independent holding. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：單一活塞準靜態推力，未含背壓、管路瞬變與額定安全係數。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Quasistatic force of one piston; back pressure, line transients and rated safety factors are excluded.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"內洩漏可造成保持位置下降但壓力讀值短時正常，空氣混入則可能使動作變軟並延遲。回到「致動推力與獨立保持」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Internal leakage can cause sag despite temporarily normal pressure, while entrained air makes motion compliant and delayed. Trace the input chain for actuation thrust and independent holding. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「致動推力與獨立保持」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Actuation thrust and independent holding\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","內洩漏可造成保持位置下降但壓力讀值短時正常，空氣混入則可能使動作變軟並延遲。","總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Internal leakage can cause sag despite temporarily normal pressure, while entrained air makes motion compliant and delayed.","Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support."],"answer":1,"explanation":"內洩漏可造成保持位置下降但壓力讀值短時正常，空氣混入則可能使動作變軟並延遲。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Internal leakage can cause sag despite temporarily normal pressure, while entrained air makes motion compliant and delayed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b398-v16-s3","title":"承載位置與支點反力與位置鎖定與路徑狀態","titleEn":"Load position and support reactions & Position, locking and route states","description":"本階段聚焦「承載位置與支點反力」與「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Load position and support reactions\" and \"Position, locking and route states\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b398-v16-17","title":"承載位置與支點反力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Load position and support reactions: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-16"],"objective":"說明「承載位置與支點反力」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Load position and support reactions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"在兩支承教學模型中移動偏心載重，觀察反力如何重新分配而總和不變。將可動構件自重和假想車重分列，避免以幾何中心代替實際重心。兩支承反力由力與力矩平衡同時決定。重心偏向一側時，該側反力增加而另一側減少，總和仍不變；平均反力看似充足不能掩蓋單側限制，支承接觸若脫離還會改變原先的邊界條件。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：剛體兩簡支靜力模型且兩支承保持接觸，忽略動態擺動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「承載位置與支點反力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Move an eccentric load in a two-support teaching model and observe reaction redistribution at constant total load. Separate moving-member weight from hypothetical vehicle weight and distinguish geometric centre from centre of gravity. Two support reactions follow both force and moment equilibrium. Moving the centre of gravity toward one support raises that reaction while reducing the other without changing the total. Adequate mean reaction cannot hide a local limit, and loss of contact changes the assumed boundary conditions. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Rigid body on two simple supports that remain in contact, neglecting dynamic swing. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Load position and support reactions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：總載重 W=200 kN；支承間距 L=4 m；重心偏心 e=0.4 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: total load W=200 kN; support spacing L=4 m; centre-of-gravity eccentricity e=0.4 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「承載位置與支點反力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Load position and support reactions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-17-k1","title":"承載位置與支點反力","titleEn":"Load position and support reactions","text":"在兩支承教學模型中移動偏心載重，觀察反力如何重新分配而總和不變。將可動構件自重和假想車重分列，避免以幾何中心代替實際重心。","textEn":"Move an eccentric load in a two-support teaching model and observe reaction redistribution at constant total load. Separate moving-member weight from hypothetical vehicle weight and distinguish geometric centre from centre of gravity.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「承載位置與支點反力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Load position and support reactions\" is correct?","options":["總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","在兩支承教學模型中移動偏心載重，觀察反力如何重新分配而總和不變。"],"optionsEn":["Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Move an eccentric load in a two-support teaching model and observe reaction redistribution at constant total load."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在兩支承教學模型中移動偏心載重，觀察反力如何重新分配而總和不變。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Move an eccentric load in a two-support teaching model and observe reaction redistribution at constant total load. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b398-v16-18","title":"承載位置與支點反力：定量估算","titleEn":"Load position and support reactions: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「承載位置與支點反力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Load position and support reactions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：總載重 W=200 kN；支承間距 L=4 m；重心偏心 e=0.4 m。公式 y=W*(0.5+e/L)，代入得 y=120 kN。邊界：剛體兩簡支靜力模型且兩支承保持接觸，忽略動態擺動。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: total load W=200 kN; support spacing L=4 m; centre-of-gravity eccentricity e=0.4 m. Formula y=W*(0.5+e/L) gives y=120 kN. Boundary: Rigid body on two simple supports that remain in contact, neglecting dynamic swing. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對兩反力之和與各自力矩，再以已知小偏心移動驗證量測方向與零點。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check the reaction sum and moments, then apply a known small eccentricity to verify sensor direction and zero.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：總載重 W=200 kN；支承間距 L=4 m；重心偏心 e=0.4 m。公式 y=W*(0.5+e/L)，代入得 y=120 kN。邊界：剛體兩簡支靜力模型且兩支承保持接觸，忽略動態擺動。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: total load W=200 kN; support spacing L=4 m; centre-of-gravity eccentricity e=0.4 m. Formula y=W*(0.5+e/L) gives y=120 kN. Boundary: Rigid body on two simple supports that remain in contact, neglecting dynamic swing.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「承載位置與支點反力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Load position and support reactions\", which statement holds?","options":["原創假想教學輸入：總載重 W=200 kN；支承間距 L=4 m；重心偏心 e=0.4 m。","裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障","系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的"],"optionsEn":["Original hypothetical teaching inputs: total load W=200 kN; support spacing L=4 m; centre-of-gravity eccentricity e=0.4 m.","Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures.","High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：總載重 W=200 kN；支承間距 L=4 m；重心偏心 e=0.4 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: total load W=200 kN; support spacing L=4 m; centre-of-gravity eccentricity e=0.4 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b398-v16-19","title":"承載位置與支點反力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Load position and support reactions: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「承載位置與支點反力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Load position and support reactions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對兩反力之和與各自力矩，再以已知小偏心移動驗證量測方向與零點。以「承載位置與支點反力」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check the reaction sum and moments, then apply a known small eccentricity to verify sensor direction and zero. For load position and support reactions, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把重心偏心 e 從 0.4 改成 0.44 m（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 120 變為 122 kN。先說明「承載位置與支點反力」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only centre-of-gravity eccentricity e from 0.4 to 0.44 m (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 120 to 122 kN. Explain the causal direction for load position and support reactions, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：把幾何中心當成重心會錯估分力，支承沉陷或接觸鬆脫又可能使靜力模型失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Confusing geometric centre with centre of gravity misallocates load; settlement or loose contact can invalidate the static model. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對兩反力之和與各自力矩，再以已知小偏心移動驗證量測方向與零點。以「承載位置與支點反力」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Check the reaction sum and moments, then apply a known small eccentricity to verify sensor direction and zero. For load position and support reactions, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把重心偏心 e 從 0.4 改成 0.44 m（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 120 變為 122 kN。先說明「承載位置與支點反力」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only centre-of-gravity eccentricity e from 0.4 to 0.44 m (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 120 to 122 kN. Explain the causal direction for load position and support reactions, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「承載位置與支點反力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Load position and support reactions\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","核對兩反力之和與各自力矩，再以已知小偏心移動驗證量測方向與零點。","馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Check the reaction sum and moments, then apply a known small eccentricity to verify sensor direction and zero.","The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam."],"answer":1,"explanation":"核對兩反力之和與各自力矩，再以已知小偏心移動驗證量測方向與零點。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check the reaction sum and moments, then apply a known small eccentricity to verify sensor direction and zero. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b398-v16-20","title":"承載位置與支點反力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Load position and support reactions: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「承載位置與支點反力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Load position and support reactions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把幾何中心當成重心會錯估分力，支承沉陷或接觸鬆脫又可能使靜力模型失效。回到「承載位置與支點反力」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Confusing geometric centre with centre of gravity misallocates load; settlement or loose contact can invalidate the static model. Trace the input chain for load position and support reactions. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：剛體兩簡支靜力模型且兩支承保持接觸，忽略動態擺動。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Rigid body on two simple supports that remain in contact, neglecting dynamic swing.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把幾何中心當成重心會錯估分力，支承沉陷或接觸鬆脫又可能使靜力模型失效。回到「承載位置與支點反力」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Confusing geometric centre with centre of gravity misallocates load; settlement or loose contact can invalidate the static model. Trace the input chain for load position and support reactions. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「承載位置與支點反力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Load position and support reactions\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","把幾何中心當成重心會錯估分力，支承沉陷或接觸鬆脫又可能使靜力模型失效。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Confusing geometric centre with centre of gravity misallocates load; settlement or loose contact can invalidate the static model."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把幾何中心當成重心會錯估分力，支承沉陷或接觸鬆脫又可能使靜力模型失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Confusing geometric centre with centre of gravity misallocates load; settlement or loose contact can invalidate the static model. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b398-v16-21","title":"位置鎖定與路徑狀態：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Position, locking and route states: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-20"],"objective":"說明「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Position, locking and route states” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"到位、鎖定與路徑允許是不同命題，任何單一訊號都不能自動代表整個介面完成。以抽象狀態圖保存未知與不一致情況，不照抄代表工程的專有控制邏輯。布林狀態組合隨變數個數指數成長，這說明逐一人工檢查很快失去效率。可達性約束能排除不可能組合，但刪除條件必須有證據；安全性質通常針對所有可達狀態，而非幾個畫面上看起來合理的狀態。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Position reached, locking established and route permission are different propositions. Preserve unknown and inconsistent combinations in an abstract graph without reproducing a reference installation's proprietary logic. Boolean combinations grow exponentially with variable count, explaining why manual enumeration soon becomes ineffective. Reachability constraints can eliminate impossible combinations, but each exclusion needs justification. Safety properties normally concern every reachable state rather than a few states that look plausible on a display. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Position, locking and route states” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits.","failure":"常見誤解：「狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Position, locking and route states”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-21-k1","title":"位置鎖定與路徑狀態","titleEn":"Position, locking and route states","text":"到位、鎖定與路徑允許是不同命題，任何單一訊號都不能自動代表整個介面完成。以抽象狀態圖保存未知與不一致情況，不照抄代表工程的專有控制邏輯。","textEn":"Position reached, locking established and route permission are different propositions. Preserve unknown and inconsistent combinations in an abstract graph without reproducing a reference installation's proprietary logic.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Position, locking and route states\" is correct?","options":["到位、鎖定與路徑允許是不同命題，任何單一訊號都不能自動代表整個介面完成。","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Position reached, locking established and route permission are different propositions.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":0,"explanation":"到位、鎖定與路徑允許是不同命題，任何單一訊號都不能自動代表整個介面完成。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Position reached, locking established and route permission are different propositions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b398-v16-22","title":"位置鎖定與路徑狀態：定量估算","titleEn":"Position, locking and route states: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Position, locking and route states” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。公式 y=2**bits，代入得 y=256 states。邊界：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits. Formula y=2**bits gives y=256 states. Boundary: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。公式 y=2**bits，代入得 y=256 states。邊界：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits. Formula y=2**bits gives y=256 states. Boundary: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Position, locking and route states\", which statement holds?","options":["測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。","致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉"],"optionsEn":["One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits.","Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b398-v16-23","title":"位置鎖定與路徑狀態：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Position, locking and route states: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Position, locking and route states” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。以「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states. For position, locking and route states, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把布林變數數量 bits 從 8 改成 9 bits（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 256 變為 512 states。先說明「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only number of Boolean state variables bits from 8 to 9 bits (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 256 to 512 states. Explain the causal direction for position, locking and route states, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。以「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states. For position, locking and route states, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把布林變數數量 bits 從 8 改成 9 bits（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 256 變為 512 states。先說明「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only number of Boolean state variables bits from 8 to 9 bits (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 256 to 512 states. Explain the causal direction for position, locking and route states, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Position, locking and route states\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零","用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.","Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b398-v16-24","title":"位置鎖定與路徑狀態：失效診斷","titleEn":"Position, locking and route states: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Position, locking and route states” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。回到「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. Trace the input chain for position, locking and route states. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。回到「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. Trace the input chain for position, locking and route states. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「位置鎖定與路徑狀態」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Position, locking and route states\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b398-v16-s4","title":"動作回授的事件次序與雙確認鏈共同原因","titleEn":"Event ordering in actuator feedback & Common causes in duplicated confirmation","description":"本階段聚焦「動作回授的事件次序」與「雙確認鏈共同原因」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Event ordering in actuator feedback\" and \"Common causes in duplicated confirmation\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b398-v16-25","title":"動作回授的事件次序：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Event ordering in actuator feedback: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-24"],"objective":"說明「動作回授的事件次序」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Event ordering in actuator feedback” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"把動作命令、機械反應和位置回授分成獨立時間點，檢查軟體顯示是否早於實體確認。將感測更新和傳輸等待列帳，範例不作現場動作延時設定。端到端延遲由量測、通訊、運算與致動串接而成。改善最快的一段通常影響有限，且平均延遲不能代表最壞尾端；定義一致的起訖事件，才能避免子系統都量到好看的數值卻漏掉交接等待。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「動作回授的事件次序」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Separate command, mechanical response and position feedback to check whether a display precedes physical confirmation. Account for sensor updates and transmission waiting without adopting example delays as field settings. End-to-end delay spans sensing, communication, computation and actuation. Improving the fastest stage often yields little benefit, and mean latency does not represent its worst tail. Consistent start and end events prevent subsystems from reporting attractive numbers while overlooking handoff queues. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Event ordering in actuator feedback” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「動作回授的事件次序」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Event ordering in actuator feedback”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-25-k1","title":"動作回授的事件次序","titleEn":"Event ordering in actuator feedback","text":"把動作命令、機械反應和位置回授分成獨立時間點，檢查軟體顯示是否早於實體確認。將感測更新和傳輸等待列帳，範例不作現場動作延時設定。","textEn":"Separate command, mechanical response and position feedback to check whether a display precedes physical confirmation. Account for sensor updates and transmission waiting without adopting example delays as field settings.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「動作回授的事件次序」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Event ordering in actuator feedback\" is correct?","options":["每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短","把動作命令、機械反應和位置回授分成獨立時間點，檢查軟體顯示是否早於實體確認。","裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障"],"optionsEn":["Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.","Separate command, mechanical response and position feedback to check whether a display precedes physical confirmation.","Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把動作命令、機械反應和位置回授分成獨立時間點，檢查軟體顯示是否早於實體確認。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Separate command, mechanical response and position feedback to check whether a display precedes physical confirmation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b398-v16-26","title":"動作回授的事件次序：定量估算","titleEn":"Event ordering in actuator feedback: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「動作回授的事件次序」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Event ordering in actuator feedback” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。公式 y=sense+network+compute+actuate，代入得 y=0.25 s。邊界：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s. Formula y=sense+network+compute+actuate gives y=0.25 s. Boundary: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。公式 y=sense+network+compute+actuate，代入得 y=0.25 s。邊界：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s. Formula y=sense+network+compute+actuate gives y=0.25 s. Boundary: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「動作回授的事件次序」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Event ordering in actuator feedback\", which statement holds?","options":["系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的","馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成","原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s。"],"optionsEn":["High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe.","The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b398-v16-27","title":"動作回授的事件次序：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Event ordering in actuator feedback: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「動作回授的事件次序」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Event ordering in actuator feedback” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。以「動作回授的事件次序」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load. For event ordering in actuator feedback, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把網路時間 network 從 0.08 改成 0.088 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.25 變為 0.258 s。先說明「動作回授的事件次序」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only network time network from 0.08 to 0.088 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.25 to 0.258 s. Explain the causal direction for event ordering in actuator feedback, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。以「動作回授的事件次序」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load. For event ordering in actuator feedback, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把網路時間 network 從 0.08 改成 0.088 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.25 變為 0.258 s。先說明「動作回授的事件次序」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only network time network from 0.08 to 0.088 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.25 to 0.258 s. Explain the causal direction for event ordering in actuator feedback, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「動作回授的事件次序」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Event ordering in actuator feedback\"?","options":["沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。","量測時不必記錄溫度、速度、運行歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位"],"optionsEn":["Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load.","Temperature, speed, operating history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b398-v16-28","title":"動作回授的事件次序：失效診斷","titleEn":"Event ordering in actuator feedback: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「動作回授的事件次序」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Event ordering in actuator feedback” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。回到「動作回授的事件次序」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. Trace the input chain for event ordering in actuator feedback. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。回到「動作回授的事件次序」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. Trace the input chain for event ordering in actuator feedback. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「動作回授的事件次序」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Event ordering in actuator feedback\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。","裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance.","Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures."],"answer":1,"explanation":"時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b398-v16-29","title":"雙確認鏈共同原因：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Common causes in duplicated confirmation: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-28"],"objective":"說明「雙確認鏈共同原因」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Common causes in duplicated confirmation” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"兩個位置通道若共用安裝支架或電源，仍可能同時產生相同錯誤。先列共享條件再比較獨立失效，讓備援論證保留機械與電氣的共同來源。兩支路都失效才失去功能的架構可降低獨立故障貢獻，卻不能消除共同原因。共同電源、相同軟體缺陷或同處淹水會同時影響兩支路；因此增加硬體數量不能取代分離、異質性與失效偵測的證據。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：共同原因先發生的簡化條件模型，其餘支路相互獨立；非安全等級認證。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「雙確認鏈共同原因」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Position channels sharing a bracket or supply may produce the same error simultaneously. Identify common mechanical and electrical conditions before combining independent failures in a redundancy argument. A function lost only when both branches fail can reduce independent contributions but cannot eliminate common causes. Shared power, identical software defects or flooding at one location can affect both branches. More hardware does not replace evidence for separation, diversity and fault detection. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Simple conditional model with common cause considered first and remaining branches independent; no safety-level certification is implied. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Common causes in duplicated confirmation” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：獨立支路失效機率 p=0.002 1；共同原因事件機率 common=0.0001 1。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: independent branch failure probability p=0.002 1; common-cause event probability common=0.0001 1.","failure":"常見誤解：「裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「雙確認鏈共同原因」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Common causes in duplicated confirmation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-29-k1","title":"雙確認鏈共同原因","titleEn":"Common causes in duplicated confirmation","text":"兩個位置通道若共用安裝支架或電源，仍可能同時產生相同錯誤。先列共享條件再比較獨立失效，讓備援論證保留機械與電氣的共同來源。","textEn":"Position channels sharing a bracket or supply may produce the same error simultaneously. Identify common mechanical and electrical conditions before combining independent failures in a redundancy argument.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雙確認鏈共同原因」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Common causes in duplicated confirmation\" is correct?","options":["裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","兩個位置通道若共用安裝支架或電源，仍可能同時產生相同錯誤。"],"optionsEn":["Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","Position channels sharing a bracket or supply may produce the same error simultaneously."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩個位置通道若共用安裝支架或電源，仍可能同時產生相同錯誤。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Position channels sharing a bracket or supply may produce the same error simultaneously. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b398-v16-30","title":"雙確認鏈共同原因：定量估算","titleEn":"Common causes in duplicated confirmation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雙確認鏈共同原因」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Common causes in duplicated confirmation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：獨立支路失效機率 p=0.002 1；共同原因事件機率 common=0.0001 1。公式 y=common+(1-common)*p*p，代入得 y=0.000104 1。邊界：共同原因先發生的簡化條件模型，其餘支路相互獨立；非安全等級認證。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: independent branch failure probability p=0.002 1; common-cause event probability common=0.0001 1. Formula y=common+(1-common)*p*p gives y=0.000104 1. Boundary: Simple conditional model with common cause considered first and remaining branches independent; no safety-level certification is implied. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把獨立與共同原因兩類試驗分開，在隔離試驗台檢查共享介面失效的影響。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Separate independent and common-cause tests, using an isolated bench to examine failures of shared interfaces.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：獨立支路失效機率 p=0.002 1；共同原因事件機率 common=0.0001 1。公式 y=common+(1-common)*p*p，代入得 y=0.000104 1。邊界：共同原因先發生的簡化條件模型，其餘支路相互獨立；非安全等級認證。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: independent branch failure probability p=0.002 1; common-cause event probability common=0.0001 1. Formula y=common+(1-common)*p*p gives y=0.000104 1. Boundary: Simple conditional model with common cause considered first and remaining branches independent; no safety-level certification is implied.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雙確認鏈共同原因」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Common causes in duplicated confirmation\", which statement holds?","options":["原創假想教學輸入：獨立支路失效機率 p=0.002 1；共同原因事件機率 common=0.0001 1。","致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉","兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零"],"optionsEn":["Original hypothetical teaching inputs: independent branch failure probability p=0.002 1; common-cause event probability common=0.0001 1.","Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking.","Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：獨立支路失效機率 p=0.002 1；共同原因事件機率 common=0.0001 1。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: independent branch failure probability p=0.002 1; common-cause event probability common=0.0001 1. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b398-v16-31","title":"雙確認鏈共同原因：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Common causes in duplicated confirmation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「雙確認鏈共同原因」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Common causes in duplicated confirmation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把獨立與共同原因兩類試驗分開，在隔離試驗台檢查共享介面失效的影響。以「雙確認鏈共同原因」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Separate independent and common-cause tests, using an isolated bench to examine failures of shared interfaces. For common causes in duplicated confirmation, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把共同原因事件機率 common 從 0.0001 改成 0.00011 1（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.000104 變為 0.000114 1。先說明「雙確認鏈共同原因」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only common-cause event probability common from 0.0001 to 0.00011 1 (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.000104 to 0.000114 1. Explain the causal direction for common causes in duplicated confirmation, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：共享電源中斷會讓看似雙備援同時失去功能，若故障偵測也共用同一支路更可能誤報正常。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Loss of a shared supply can defeat apparently duplicated equipment, especially if fault detection depends on that same branch. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把獨立與共同原因兩類試驗分開，在隔離試驗台檢查共享介面失效的影響。以「雙確認鏈共同原因」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Separate independent and common-cause tests, using an isolated bench to examine failures of shared interfaces. For common causes in duplicated confirmation, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把共同原因事件機率 common 從 0.0001 改成 0.00011 1（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.000104 變為 0.000114 1。先說明「雙確認鏈共同原因」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only common-cause event probability common from 0.0001 to 0.00011 1 (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.000104 to 0.000114 1. Explain the causal direction for common causes in duplicated confirmation, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雙確認鏈共同原因」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Common causes in duplicated confirmation\"?","options":["沿用另一處鐵路設施或路線的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","把獨立與共同原因兩類試驗分開，在隔離試驗台檢查共享介面失效的影響。","總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another railway facility or route counts as verifying this structure.","Separate independent and common-cause tests, using an isolated bench to examine failures of shared interfaces.","Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把獨立與共同原因兩類試驗分開，在隔離試驗台檢查共享介面失效的影響。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Separate independent and common-cause tests, using an isolated bench to examine failures of shared interfaces. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b398-v16-32","title":"雙確認鏈共同原因：失效診斷","titleEn":"Common causes in duplicated confirmation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雙確認鏈共同原因」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Common causes in duplicated confirmation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"共享電源中斷會讓看似雙備援同時失去功能，若故障偵測也共用同一支路更可能誤報正常。回到「雙確認鏈共同原因」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Loss of a shared supply can defeat apparently duplicated equipment, especially if fault detection depends on that same branch. Trace the input chain for common causes in duplicated confirmation. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：共同原因先發生的簡化條件模型，其餘支路相互獨立；非安全等級認證。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Simple conditional model with common cause considered first and remaining branches independent; no safety-level certification is implied.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「裝設兩套相同設備就能完全消除共同原因故障」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Installing two identical systems completely removes common-cause failures.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"共享電源中斷會讓看似雙備援同時失去功能，若故障偵測也共用同一支路更可能誤報正常。回到「雙確認鏈共同原因」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Loss of a shared supply can defeat apparently duplicated equipment, especially if fault detection depends on that same branch. Trace the input chain for common causes in duplicated confirmation. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雙確認鏈共同原因」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Common causes in duplicated confirmation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","共享電源中斷會讓看似雙備援同時失去功能，若故障偵測也共用同一支路更可能誤報正常。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","Loss of a shared supply can defeat apparently duplicated equipment, especially if fault detection depends on that same branch."],"answer":2,"explanation":"共享電源中斷會讓看似雙備援同時失去功能，若故障偵測也共用同一支路更可能誤報正常。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Loss of a shared supply can defeat apparently duplicated equipment, especially if fault detection depends on that same branch. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b398-v16-s5","title":"中止偏斜與失訊案例與維修恢復與服務條件","titleEn":"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases & Maintenance recovery and service conditions","description":"本階段聚焦「中止偏斜與失訊案例」與「維修恢復與服務條件」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases\" and \"Maintenance recovery and service conditions\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b398-v16-33","title":"中止偏斜與失訊案例：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-32"],"objective":"說明「中止偏斜與失訊案例」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"把正常切換、行程中止和確認失聯分成不同試驗，不以多次成功動作代表全部狀態。用離線重播追蹤每項需求，保留安全停止後的復原邊界。測試覆蓋率只對已定義的分母有意義。需求、狀態、轉移與危害各有不同分母，執行很多正常案例仍可能漏掉罕見但重要的交接；同一案例重跑多次不會自動增加獨立需求的覆蓋。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「中止偏斜與失訊案例」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Treat normal switching, interrupted travel and lost confirmation as distinct tests rather than counting repeated successful moves as full coverage. Trace requirements through offline replay and retain recovery boundaries after safe withdrawal. Coverage is meaningful only relative to its defined denominator. Requirements, states, transitions and hazards have different denominators. Many normal cases can still omit a rare but important handoff, and repeating one case does not automatically cover additional independent requirements. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases.","failure":"常見誤解：「測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「中止偏斜與失訊案例」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-33-k1","title":"中止偏斜與失訊案例","titleEn":"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases","text":"把正常切換、行程中止和確認失聯分成不同試驗，不以多次成功動作代表全部狀態。用離線重播追蹤每項需求，保留安全停止後的復原邊界。","textEn":"Treat normal switching, interrupted travel and lost confirmation as distinct tests rather than counting repeated successful moves as full coverage. Trace requirements through offline replay and retain recovery boundaries after safe withdrawal.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「中止偏斜與失訊案例」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases\" is correct?","options":["把正常切換、行程中止和確認失聯分成不同試驗，不以多次成功動作代表全部狀態。","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的"],"optionsEn":["Treat normal switching, interrupted travel and lost confirmation as distinct tests rather than counting repeated successful moves as full coverage.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把正常切換、行程中止和確認失聯分成不同試驗，不以多次成功動作代表全部狀態。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Treat normal switching, interrupted travel and lost confirmation as distinct tests rather than counting repeated successful moves as full coverage. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b398-v16-34","title":"中止偏斜與失訊案例：定量估算","titleEn":"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「中止偏斜與失訊案例」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。公式 y=tested/total，代入得 y=0.8 1。邊界：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases. Formula y=tested/total gives y=0.8 1. Boundary: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。公式 y=tested/total，代入得 y=0.8 1。邊界：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases. Formula y=tested/total gives y=0.8 1. Boundary: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「中止偏斜與失訊案例」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases\", which statement holds?","options":["馬達角度已達目標就能保證懸掛式轉轍梁定位完成","原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。","油壓讀值正常就能單獨保證負載永遠保持原位"],"optionsEn":["The target motor angle guarantees completed positioning of a suspended switch beam.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases.","A normal hydraulic pressure reading alone guarantees that the load remains fixed indefinitely."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b398-v16-35","title":"中止偏斜與失訊案例：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「中止偏斜與失訊案例」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。以「中止偏斜與失訊案例」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence. For interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把已執行案例 tested 從 72 改成 73 cases（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.8 變為 0.811111 1。先說明「中止偏斜與失訊案例」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only executed cases tested from 72 to 73 cases (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.8 to 0.811111 1. Explain the causal direction for interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。以「中止偏斜與失訊案例」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence. For interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把已執行案例 tested 從 72 改成 73 cases（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.8 變為 0.811111 1。先說明「中止偏斜與失訊案例」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only executed cases tested from 72 to 73 cases (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.8 to 0.811111 1. Explain the causal direction for interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「中止偏斜與失訊案例」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence."],"answer":2,"explanation":"建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b398-v16-36","title":"中止偏斜與失訊案例：失效診斷","titleEn":"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「中止偏斜與失訊案例」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。回到「中止偏斜與失訊案例」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. Trace the input chain for interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。回到「中止偏斜與失訊案例」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. Trace the input chain for interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「中止偏斜與失訊案例」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的"],"optionsEn":["Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe."],"answer":0,"explanation":"縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b398-v16-37","title":"維修恢復與服務條件：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Maintenance recovery and service conditions: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-36"],"objective":"說明「維修恢復與服務條件」如何影響懸掛式單軌轉轍系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Maintenance recovery and service conditions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Suspended-monorail switch systems”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"區分機構修復、確認鏈恢復和旅客服務恢復，三者時間點不必相同。以維修履歷比較短停與長停，避免可用度數字掩蓋仍未完成的承載或鎖定證據。可用度描述長時間內能提供服務的比例，故障頻率與修復速度都會影響它。相同可用度可能來自頻繁短停或罕見長停，對旅客與維修資源的影響不同；更不能把高可用度直接解讀為故障發生時一定安全。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：可修復二狀態穩態模型，未含共同原因故障、預防保養與供應鏈等待。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「維修恢復與服務條件」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Distinguish mechanism repair, confirmation recovery and passenger-service restoration because their timestamps may differ. Compare short and long outages without letting availability conceal incomplete load-path or locking evidence. Availability describes the fraction of long-run time during which service is possible; both failure frequency and repair duration matter. The same value can arise from frequent brief outages or rare long ones with different passenger and maintenance consequences. High availability does not itself establish safe behaviour during failure. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Repairable two-state steady model; common-cause failures, planned maintenance and supply-chain waiting are excluded. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Maintenance recovery and service conditions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：平均故障間隔 mtbf=2000 h；平均修復時間 mttr=4 h。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: mean time between failures mtbf=2000 h; mean repair time mttr=4 h.","failure":"常見誤解：「系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「維修恢復與服務條件」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Maintenance recovery and service conditions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-37-k1","title":"維修恢復與服務條件","titleEn":"Maintenance recovery and service conditions","text":"區分機構修復、確認鏈恢復和旅客服務恢復，三者時間點不必相同。以維修履歷比較短停與長停，避免可用度數字掩蓋仍未完成的承載或鎖定證據。","textEn":"Distinguish mechanism repair, confirmation recovery and passenger-service restoration because their timestamps may differ. Compare short and long outages without letting availability conceal incomplete load-path or locking evidence.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「維修恢復與服務條件」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Maintenance recovery and service conditions\" is correct?","options":["系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的","區分機構修復、確認鏈恢復和旅客服務恢復，三者時間點不必相同。","致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉"],"optionsEn":["High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe.","Distinguish mechanism repair, confirmation recovery and passenger-service restoration because their timestamps may differ.","Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"區分機構修復、確認鏈恢復和旅客服務恢復，三者時間點不必相同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Distinguish mechanism repair, confirmation recovery and passenger-service restoration because their timestamps may differ. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b398-v16-38","title":"維修恢復與服務條件：定量估算","titleEn":"Maintenance recovery and service conditions: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「維修恢復與服務條件」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Maintenance recovery and service conditions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：平均故障間隔 mtbf=2000 h；平均修復時間 mttr=4 h。公式 y=mtbf/(mtbf+mttr)，代入得 y=0.998004 1。邊界：可修復二狀態穩態模型，未含共同原因故障、預防保養與供應鏈等待。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: mean time between failures mtbf=2000 h; mean repair time mttr=4 h. Formula y=mtbf/(mtbf+mttr) gives y=0.998004 1. Boundary: Repairable two-state steady model; common-cause failures, planned maintenance and supply-chain waiting are excluded. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分別核對故障起點、服務恢復及完全修復時間，避免把部分恢復誤列為全功能。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Audit failure onset, service restoration and full repair separately rather than counting degraded service as full functionality.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：平均故障間隔 mtbf=2000 h；平均修復時間 mttr=4 h。公式 y=mtbf/(mtbf+mttr)，代入得 y=0.998004 1。邊界：可修復二狀態穩態模型，未含共同原因故障、預防保養與供應鏈等待。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: mean time between failures mtbf=2000 h; mean repair time mttr=4 h. Formula y=mtbf/(mtbf+mttr) gives y=0.998004 1. Boundary: Repairable two-state steady model; common-cause failures, planned maintenance and supply-chain waiting are excluded.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「維修恢復與服務條件」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Maintenance recovery and service conditions\", which statement holds?","options":["兩致動器瞬間速度相同就能證明已累積的位置差為零","總重量不變時左右支承的載重也一定不變","原創假想教學輸入：平均故障間隔 mtbf=2000 h；平均修復時間 mttr=4 h。"],"optionsEn":["Equal instantaneous actuator speeds prove that the accumulated position difference is zero.","Unchanged total weight guarantees unchanged load at each support.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: mean time between failures mtbf=2000 h; mean repair time mttr=4 h."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：平均故障間隔 mtbf=2000 h；平均修復時間 mttr=4 h。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: mean time between failures mtbf=2000 h; mean repair time mttr=4 h. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b398-v16-39","title":"維修恢復與服務條件：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Maintenance recovery and service conditions: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「維修恢復與服務條件」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Maintenance recovery and service conditions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分別核對故障起點、服務恢復及完全修復時間，避免把部分恢復誤列為全功能。以「維修恢復與服務條件」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Audit failure onset, service restoration and full repair separately rather than counting degraded service as full functionality. For maintenance recovery and service conditions, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把平均修復時間 mttr 從 4 改成 4.4 h（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.998004 變為 0.997805 1。先說明「維修恢復與服務條件」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only mean repair time mttr from 4 to 4.4 h (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.998004 to 0.997805 1. Explain the causal direction for maintenance recovery and service conditions, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：刪除長停機紀錄會扭曲平均修復時間；重複報修同一缺陷則會錯估故障頻率。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Removing long outages distorts mean repair time, while duplicate reports of one defect distort failure frequency. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分別核對故障起點、服務恢復及完全修復時間，避免把部分恢復誤列為全功能。以「維修恢復與服務條件」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Audit failure onset, service restoration and full repair separately rather than counting degraded service as full functionality. For maintenance recovery and service conditions, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把平均修復時間 mttr 從 4 改成 4.4 h（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.998004 變為 0.997805 1。先說明「維修恢復與服務條件」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only mean repair time mttr from 4 to 4.4 h (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.998004 to 0.997805 1. Explain the causal direction for maintenance recovery and service conditions, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「維修恢復與服務條件」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Maintenance recovery and service conditions\"?","options":["分別核對故障起點、服務恢復及完全修復時間，避免把部分恢復誤列為全功能。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Audit failure onset, service restoration and full repair separately rather than counting degraded service as full functionality.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":0,"explanation":"分別核對故障起點、服務恢復及完全修復時間，避免把部分恢復誤列為全功能。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Audit failure onset, service restoration and full repair separately rather than counting degraded service as full functionality. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b398-v16-40","title":"維修恢復與服務條件：失效診斷","titleEn":"Maintenance recovery and service conditions: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b398-v16-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「維修恢復與服務條件」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Maintenance recovery and service conditions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"刪除長停機紀錄會扭曲平均修復時間；重複報修同一缺陷則會錯估故障頻率。回到「維修恢復與服務條件」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Removing long outages distorts mean repair time, while duplicate reports of one defect distort failure frequency. Trace the input chain for maintenance recovery and service conditions. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：可修復二狀態穩態模型，未含共同原因故障、預防保養與供應鏈等待。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Repairable two-state steady model; common-cause failures, planned maintenance and supply-chain waiting are excluded.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「系統可用度很高就能直接證明所有故障都是安全的」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"High system availability directly proves that every failure is safe.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b398-v16-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"刪除長停機紀錄會扭曲平均修復時間；重複報修同一缺陷則會錯估故障頻率。回到「維修恢復與服務條件」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Removing long outages distorts mean repair time, while duplicate reports of one defect distort failure frequency. Trace the input chain for maintenance recovery and service conditions. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]},{"id":"b398-v16-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「維修恢復與服務條件」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Maintenance recovery and service conditions\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","刪除長停機紀錄會扭曲平均修復時間；重複報修同一缺陷則會錯估故障頻率。","致動器走完行程就能保證機構已完成安全鎖閉"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Removing long outages distorts mean repair time, while duplicate reports of one defect distort failure frequency.","Completing actuator travel guarantees safe mechanical locking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"刪除長停機紀錄會扭曲平均修復時間；重複報修同一缺陷則會錯估故障頻率。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Removing long outages distorts mean repair time, while duplicate reports of one defect distort failure frequency. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v16s-wuppertal","v16s-iso-risk","v16s-iso-control","v16s-dresden-reference"],"curriculumVersion":16,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000,"flowDiagram":"assets/diagrams/v16-b398-zh.svg","flowDiagramEn":"assets/diagrams/v16-b398-en.svg"}};
